Please also review the following third-party / data considerations, which are
NOT governed by this repository's code license:

1. DINOv3 backbone weights.
   The released checkpoint (checkpoints/emg2force_prevforce.ckpt) contains
   fine-tuned weights of a DINOv3 ViT-S/16 backbone (timm id
   "vit_small_patch16_dinov3.lvd1689m"), which derives from Meta's DINOv3
   release. Redistribution of these weights must comply with the DINOv3 license.
   Confirm this before publishing the checkpoint.

2. Dataset.
   The HDF5 sessions under data/ and the paired RGB videos under data/videos/
   are recordings collected by the authors. State the intended data license here
   (the model/data are intended for research use).

3. Clean-room reimplementation.
   The code in emg2force/ is an independent reimplementation of the evaluation /
   fine-tuning path. It does NOT include source from the emg2pose project
   (which is distributed under CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0); that license therefore does not
   attach to this code.
